description:
The send_chat_message MCP tool returns {"success":false} with no error message or error_code, making it impossible for the LLM to understand what went wrong.

Evidence:
- game_20260216_155314_g4: Gem3P Sport tried "Pop pop! Otters taking it home! GG!" -> {"success":false}
- game_20260216_112019_g8: Gem3P Proud tried "GG! Those Slicks are slippery." -> {"success":false}

Both failures were from Gemini 3 Pro Preview models. The response has no error field, just success:false.

Suggested fix: Add an error message to the response when send_chat_message fails, e.g. {"success":false,"error":"reason here"}.
